+					[['a', 'Then you’re fine. PDFs and images you make with {font} are your client work, and {client} can print and post them as much as they like. Fonts embedded in a PDF for printing are covered too.'], ['c', 'Brilliant, thank you.']],
+					[['a', 'That’s all covered: finished artwork, including print-ready PDFs with the fonts embedded, is part of your work for them. Nothing else for you to do.'], ['c', 'Great. Does the printer need anything from me?'], ['a', 'No. A printer working from your PDF is producing your client’s job, so the embedded fonts are all they need.']]
