+		more: ['[Attachment: {clientSlug}-logo-v3.png, 214 KB]\n\nIcon on the left, name on the right, all one colour.', 'I’d hate to hand over a logo they can’t use.', 'It’s a small business, nothing fancy, but they’ll be using it for years so I want it right.'],
